cff-version: 1.2.0
title: LLaMA-Factory Trainer for Runpod Serverless
message: If you use this worker, please cite it and upstream LlamaFactory (Zheng et al., ACL 2024).
type: software
authors:
  - name: prilojject
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/prilojject/runpod-llama-factory
url: https://prilojject.github.io/runpod-llama-factory/
abstract: >-
  A Runpod Serverless worker for headless LlamaFactory v0.9.5 fine-tuning
  (LoRA / QLoRA / freeze / full; SFT, DPO, ORPO, SimPO and KTO). Send an
  official LlamaFactory YAML or form fields plus an alpaca/sharegpt dataset;
  get an adapter (adapter_model.safetensors + adapter_config.json).
keywords:
  - llamafactory
  - llama-factory
  - fine-tuning
  - lora
  - qlora
  - sft
  - dpo
  - orpo
  - kto
  - runpod
  - serverless
